{"t":"Ankrahmun Libraries","s":"ankrahmun-libraries-06c5f","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Ankrahmun_Temple_Map_00798b.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> has three different library sections:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Ankrahmun Temple;</li>\n<li>Great Pyramid;</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Libraries\">Serpentine Tower</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>Some other books can also be found around the city. In addition, some more books can be found in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27labal\">Kha'labal</a> desert and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel\">Kha'zeel</a> mountain range.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Ankrahmun\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Temple\">Temple</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ankrahmun Temple Map\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"76\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ankrahmun_Temple_Map_00798b.png\" width=\"87\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ankrahmun Temple Library\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ankrahmun_Temple_Library_12f2c1.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></span>\n</p><p>The Ankrahmun Temple is located in the east-central part of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33195,32852,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33195, 32852, 7)</a>. This is where a character can go to become a citizen of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>. You can also accomplish this at any <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple\">Temple</a> in most of the cities in Tibia.\n</p><p>These bookcases are <i>EMPTY:</i><br/>\nSecond, Fifth, Ninth, Tenth.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Uthun (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Red)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Red_1463e9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The contrast between the Uthun and the Akh, concerning spirituality in Ankrahmun.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Third Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Banished Pharaohs' Tombs (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Black)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Black_3404b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Banishment of the seven conspirators.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Fourth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Akh'rah Uthun (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Red)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Red_1463e9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Ankrahmun spirituality and the combination of the Akh and Uthun.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Sixth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Importance of Time to the Dead (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Grey)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Grey_656a66.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">What is time, and how important is it to the living and the dead.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Seventh Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Akh (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Red)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Red_1463e9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Lamenting the existence of the Akh, and entreating readers to seek ascention.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Eighth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Poem of Praise to the Pharaoh (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Blue)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Blue_3cfc08.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">A poem praising the Pharaoh.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Great_Pyramid\">Great Pyramid</span></h3>\n<p>The <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33150,32844,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Great Pyramid (33150, 32844, 7)</a> is at the center of the city of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>. This is where the Pharaoh lives in his undying state. There are two floors of library in the pyramid, and a large <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Library%20Tomb\">tomb</a> beneath it.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ankrahmun Great Pyramid2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"167\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ankrahmun_Great_Pyramid2_84d86b.jpg\" width=\"388\"/></span><br/>\nAt the ground floor level of the pyramid, there are some bookcases.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Greater Challenges (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Red)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Red_1463e9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The master of the games requests more dangerous creatures.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Second Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Esuph III and the Tax Collector (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Black)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Black_3404b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">A tax collector schemes to get rich, and is executed.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Third Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Right Honourable Excreminator (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Grey)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Grey_656a66.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The position of the right honourable excreminator is established.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Fourth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Snake Chamber (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Fat Green)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Fat_Green_b9afd9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Some explorers are saved from certain death in a pit of snakes.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Fifth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Will the World Never Learn (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Red)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Red_1463e9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">An ambassador visits Ankrahmun and insults the religion of the Pharaohs.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Sixth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Crime and Punishment Under Harrah II (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Orange)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Orange_a8ad8f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">A series of stories about law-breakers and how they were punished.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">A Witch in the Rathal I Pyramid (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Black)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Black_3404b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The Rathal I Pyramid is declared free from occult activity, and a witch is thought to be hiding the jungle.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Great Pyramid First Floor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"193\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Great_Pyramid_First_Floor_24ef17.jpg\" width=\"372\"/></span><br/>\nThe first floor of the pyramid, right above the ground floor, has another series of bookcases.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Tombs%20%28Book%29\">Ancient Tombs (Book)</a></td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">A poem about the ancient tombs.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Second Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Tibian Wonders of the World I (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_Square_fc952f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown Thin)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_Thin_d18709.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">First list of the known and acknowledged wonders of the Tibian world.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Third Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Rahmen Tah and the Vizier I (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Orange)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Orange_a8ad8f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The court astologer Athem gets tasked with killing an evil vizier.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Rahmen Tah and the Vizier II (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Orange)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Orange_a8ad8f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Athem knows what to do in order to kill the evil vizier and saves the whole of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Fourth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Conspirators (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Black)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Black_3404b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The conspirators against the Pharaoh.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Fifth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Tales of a Stranger I (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Tales of a Stranger II (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">?</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Sixth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Legacy of the Tombs (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Orange)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Orange_a8ad8f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">History of the tombs</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Seventh Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Great Ankrahmunian Escape (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Black)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Black_3404b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Whilst on a diplomatic expidition to <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmunian</a> princess falls in love with a young Thaian.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Eighth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Treasures of the Desert (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">A log of a team's excavations in the deserts of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darama\">Darama</a> presumably.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Serpentine_Tower\">Serpentine Tower</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Serpentine Tower view\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"164\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Serpentine_fa75dd.jpg\" width=\"180\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Serpentine Tower view</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The Serpentine Tower (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33148,32867,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33148, 32867, 7)</a>) is a mysterious place in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>. It seems there have been spell studies on this place, and even today any sorcerer can go here to learn spells from the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tothdral\">ancient teacher</a>. There is also the White Pearl Quest on the ground floor. Underneath is a mysterious room, containing a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elemental</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire\">Vampire</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoth</a>. The Fire Elemental can be released out of its room using a lever on the floor above. Below there is a room that is thought to be a joke of CipSoft. In this room are many strange items, including a Boots of Water Walking and a \"portable hole\". The portable hole appears to be one of the phases a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sudden%20Death\">SD rune</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Strike\">Death Strike</a> takes as it hit the target. No one is yet to find out what it does. This room can be opened by using the switch underneath the <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elemental</a>. No one so far has been able to free the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire\">Vampire</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoth</a>, however, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a> that spawns down there and the 4 empty coal basins hold some thought. These 4 empty coal basins could be to do with the 4 monsters that spawn in the tower, but it is unknown.\nOn test servers players have somehow released the Behemoth, whether this is with Gamemaster co-operation or not is unknown.\n</p><p>There is also another lever located beneath an energy field in the room with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a>. What it does is still unknown.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Serpentine Tower Djinn room hidden lever\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"366\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Serpentine_Tower_Djinn_room_hidden_lever_232051.jpg\" width=\"425\"/></span>\n</p><p>This is the lever beneath the left most energy field in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a> room of the Serpentine Tower\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Serpentine Tower Map\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Serpentine_Tower_Map_c224ed.png\" width=\"68\"/></span>\n</p><p>The tower is located south east of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a> and up one level.<br/>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Serpentine Tower library (floor +1)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"264\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Serpentine_Tower_library_floor_1_2ded4d.jpg\" width=\"264\"/></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Mehrah Asram (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Fat Green)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Fat_Green_b9afd9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Another baffling tibian language, probably placed by the notorious Knightmare</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Improved Find Person Spell (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sheet%20of%20Paper\"><img alt=\"Paper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sheet_of_Paper_64a83b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Research into improving the Find Person spell.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Foeburner Spell (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sheet%20of%20Paper\"><img alt=\"Paper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sheet_of_Paper_64a83b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Research into the \"Foeburner\" spell</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Second Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Lamp of Tazur (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_Square_fc952f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The myth and legend about the Lamp of Tazur.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Third Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Lost Garden (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The legend about the lost garden of Princess Maharuh</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Controlled Demon Summoning (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sheet%20of%20Paper\"><img alt=\"Paper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sheet_of_Paper_64a83b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Summoning strong demonic creatures.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Fourth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Suns and Stars I (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Blue)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Blue_3cfc08.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Astral patterns and the effect celestial bodies have upon magic and mana.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Suns and Stars II (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Blue)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Blue_3cfc08.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Astral patterns and the effect celestial bodies have upon magic and mana.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Fifth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Legion of Slaughter (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Grey)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Grey_656a66.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">About ancients races and beings from the god wars.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Ancient Mummies (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Describing mummies and warning against their magic.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Stoneskin Spell (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sheet%20of%20Paper\"><img alt=\"Paper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sheet_of_Paper_64a83b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Researching the \"stoneskin\" spell.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Sixth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Larokhon (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Grey)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Grey_656a66.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The deadly entities that are completely formed from wind and heat.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Morgathla Reveals the Secrets of the Mask (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Black)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Black_3404b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Morgathla reveals the secrets of the mask. The secrets are passed on to the pharaohs.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Seventh Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">About Rewar the Bloody (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Black)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Black_3404b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Telling the tale of Rewar the Bloody</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Recovering the Secret of the Mask (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Orange)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Orange_a8ad8f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">The pharaoh forges high masks, but orders their destruction because of the lost secrets.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Eighth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Forbidden Spell (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sheet%20of%20Paper\"><img alt=\"Paper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sheet_of_Paper_64a83b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">XXXXXX research has been abandoned at the request of the pharaoh</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Ninth Bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">The Great Pyramid and the Undying Pharaoh (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown Thin)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_Thin_d18709.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Story of the undying pharaohs, and the tombs beneath the great pyramid.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Move Earth Spell (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sheet%20of%20Paper\"><img alt=\"Paper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sheet_of_Paper_64a83b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Research into the \"move earth\" spell.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Serpentine Tower library (floor 0)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"279\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Serpentine_Tower_library_floor_0_a3ae06.jpg\" width=\"435\"/></span>\n</p><p>Below the library room is another room which contains:\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First (Table)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Divination Spell (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sheet%20of%20Paper\"><img alt=\"Paper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sheet_of_Paper_64a83b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">?</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Second (Drawer)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Cat-Eye Spell (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sheet%20of%20Paper\"><img alt=\"Paper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sheet_of_Paper_64a83b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Research on the cat-eye spell.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Others\">Others</span></h3>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Offline Training (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Large Book\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Large_Book_95d5af.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">How to train when offline.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Sacred%20Casket%20%28Book%29\">The Sacred Casket (Book)</a></td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Parchment\"><img alt=\"Parchment\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_77aa91.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Discusses the nomad tribe's <a href=\"#/wiki/Jewel%20Case%20%28Nomad%29\">casket</a>.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\"w-Kha.27labal\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Kha'labal\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27labal\">Kha'labal</a></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Type\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Incompetent Idiots (Book)\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Old Piece of Paper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Old_Piece_of_Paper_8b58e7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tzumrah%20the%20Dazzler\">Master Tzumrah</a> is furious with his incompetent minions.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\"w-Kha.27zeel\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Kha'zeel\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel\">Kha'zeel</a></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Type\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Famous Recipes by Maître Jean Pierre I (Book)\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Jean Pierre's Cookbook I\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jean_Pierre_s_Cookbook_I_51081c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">A bunch of high-quality recipes.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Famous Recipes by Maître Jean Pierre II (Book)\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Jean Pierre's Cookbook II\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jean_Pierre_s_Cookbook_II_90baf1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">A bunch of high-quality recipes.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>","quests":["serpentine-tower-quest"]}